code loops_through_finally
  slots: 0=i@loop, 1=<loop state>, 2=<unwinding>
             0 LOAD_CONST           0 (1)
    36       1 LOOP_NUMBER          1 ("the start of a 'for' range")
             2 LOAD_CONST           2 (5)
             3 LOOP_NUMBER          3 ("the end of a 'for' range")
             4 RANGE_PREP           1 (<loop state>)
